% BPHY-2018-08 fig_01b: Bc+ -> J/psi Ds(*)+, colour-suppressed spectator diagram
layout: v2
in: b1 c1
out: cb c2 s1 c3
w1 -- [fermion] b1 [\bar b]
cb [\bar c] -- [fermion] w1
w1 -- [boson, label=W] w2
s1 [\bar s] -- [fermion] w2 -- [fermion] c2 [c]
c1 [c] -- [fermion] c3 [c]
meson: B_c^+ = b1 c1
meson: J/\psi = cb c2
meson: D_s^{(*)+} = s1 c3
